<title>USA: Advest Group Inc Q1 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Advest Group Inc Q1 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p> Revenues				   $69,878	 $65,048</p>
<p> Income before taxes			5,879	   5,800</p>
<p> Net income				   3,292	   3,132</p>
<p>Net income per share:</p>
<p>  Primary					0.38	    0.36</p>
<p>  Assuming full dilution		   0.34	    0.33</p>
<p>Average shares outstanding:</p>
<p>  Primary				     8,643	   8,773</p>
<p>  Assuming full dilution		 10,184	  10,301</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest qtr after $0.6 million pre-tax debt retirement charge. Primary shr excluding charge was $0.42.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
